inksight-api
============

This package is a restructured, object-oriented port of the example code
published with "InkSight: Offline-to-Online Handwriting Conversion by Teaching
Vision-Language Models to Read and Write" (Mitrevski, Rak, Schnitzler, Li,
Maksai, Berent, Musat; TMLR 2025):

    https://github.com/google-research/inksight   (colab.ipynb)

The original notebook code is
    Copyright 2024 Google LLC
and is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Changes: the notebook's functions and duplicated helpers were reorganised into
a layered package of classes with documented extension points. The model
weights, the dataset and any ink produced from them are NOT part of this
package; they come from the sources below and carry their own terms.

Model weights and data
----------------------
The InkSight model (https://huggingface.co/Derendering/InkSight-Small-p), the
supplementary derendering dataset and the human-tracing data are released by
the authors under Apache-2.0 for RESEARCH, NON-COMMERCIAL use only, because
they derive from non-commercial research datasets. The model card also asks
that it not be used for privacy-intruding purposes such as forging
handwriting.

This is not an officially supported Google product.
